error[SC0104]: this `#line` is not read
   ╭─[ a_line_name_with_a_universal_character_name_is_refused.c:1:1 ]
   │
 1 │ #line 1 "\u0041.c"
   │ ┬  
   │ ╰── directive begins here
───╯
  = note: `"\u0041.c"` names its file with a universal character name, which is not read in a `#line` name, as it is not in a string literal yet
  = note: `#line` is read as a line from 1 to 2147483647 in decimal digits, and a string literal with no prefix after it if it names the file
